      "standard_id": "CSDM",
      "name": "Core Scientific Dataset Model (CSDM) / Core Scientific Dataset (CSD) model",
      "description": "A lightweight, portable data model and JSON-serialized file format for representing multi-dimensional scientific datasets. Defines independent variables (dimensions), dependent variables, data sampling on orthogonal regular or rectilinear grids, support for correlated multi-component dependent variables, and the minimal metadata needed to represent coordinate systems and data arrays for exchange and archival. Accompanied by the csdmpy Python library with tutorials and serialization examples."
    }
